# GitHub project #42: ignore the scratch/live dump and error log, but allow a
# deliberately committed snapshot at data/p42.json (the web env cannot fetch #42
# live - GraphQL is blocked - so it is refreshed from local gh / CI and committed).
/p42.json
p42.err
data/*
!data/p42.json
